# The Node images build from the repository root, so keep the context small:
# a stale node_modules or dist copied in would shadow the clean install the
# Dockerfile performs.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/.vite/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

docs/
infra/apache/
*.md
!apps/*/README.md

**/*.log
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
